SUMMARY:Story Time at the Museum
DESCRIPTION:This is a free program in the Windows on the World classroom\, located on the 3rd floor of the Nature Exploration Center in downtown Raleigh. Story Time is designed especially for children 5 and younger and books are chosen with this age group in mind. \nPlease note that we do not guarantee the opportunity to touch live animals during this program.
